To start Kragar is the tough to notice, quite effective Lieutenant to
Vladimir Taltos in Stephen Brust's Jhereg Series.  As for my plan for this
rogue, I wanted to get him to expert in dagger, dual weild Magicbane and
perhaps a silver dagger.  I had expected to have to wish for MB, but the
Bones of a W yielded it.  I was also going Genoless (as usual for me)  but
my normal polyless conduct was out, as I didn't relish the yo-yo method of
finishing the Ro Quest.  I did a bit of polypiling in this game, after
finding Ludious. (first time in a while!)  I ended up finding a mess of ?oEW
and a worm tooth before the quest, so I decided to dual weild MB and a
