vampire named "Vlad the Impaler" of all things had a candelabrum that seemed
to go with the bell that Assassin left.  On the same floor as the stairs to
Vlad's tower was a haunted town run by a demon named Orcus.  I chased him
down the stairs (or was it he who chased me?) on the floor below he summoned
a beast called a Master Mind Flayer among other things.  The tentacled thing
had been called a Mind Flayer so I was concerned.  I shot it with a wand of
