scrolls.



The second portal leads me to a lava plain.  I have to fight the Ki-rin
before proceding, after using the scroll I float over the lava and enter the
third portal.



The plane of water was populated by many sea creatures, water elementals,
and that annoying wizard.  The wizard was shown Orcus' wand for the last
time.  I changed back to my Speed boots at this point.  The portal was
located, and duly floated in to my air bubble. eventually.



The astral plane had a welcoming party of Three Master Liches and a guardian
